## Key Concepts
- Cloud Run revisions, traffic splitting, and proxy patterns
- Tenant isolation via service accounts and per-tenant config storage (Secret Manager / Firestore)
- Observability (Cloud Monitoring, Cloud Logging)
- Canary testing and rollback strategies

## Code Example
